---
import AhutongNav from "./AhutongNav.astro";
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
import "../../styles/ahutong.css";
---

<section aria-label="安大通安装与体验">
  <AhutongNav />
  <div class="ahutong-grid">
    <div class="ahutong-panel">
      <p class="ahutong-eyebrow">iOS · Self-sign</p>
      <h2>用自己的账号，安装安大通</h2>
      <p>准备电脑、数据线与 IPA，跟随 Sideloadly 教程完成安装和后续续签。</p>
      <div class="ahutong-actions">
        <Button variant="outline" href="/projects/ahutong/ios/"
          >查看自签教程 →</Button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ahutong-panel ahutong-panel--feature">
      <p class="ahutong-eyebrow">iOS · Waitlist</p>
      <h2>想让安装更简单？</h2>
      <p>
        关注团队签名体验计划。按测试批次邀请，收到邀请后完成设备登记与安装。
      </p>
      <div class="ahutong-actions">
        <Button href="/waitlist/">了解体验申请 →</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a class="ahutong-source" href="/projects/ahutong/changelog/"
    >查看近期版本更新 →</a
  >
</section>
